Package: grafana-beyla-sdk
Version: 0.1.0~poc1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: alloy (>= 1.21.0), systemd, debconf, python3
Maintainer: Gregor Zeitlinger <gregor.zeitlinger@grafana.com>
Description: Experimental Beyla SDK instrumentation companion for Alloy
 Experimental, unpublished Ubuntu amd64 companion package. Configures the
 Alloy service with embedded beyla.ebpf, host metrics and profiling, and
 optionally enrolls explicitly selected systemd services for SDK injection.
